		<content type="html"><![CDATA[<p>C&#039;est le genre de raisons ou cela me soule les processus entreprise &gt;&lt;&quot;<br />où les versions date d&#039;il y a 5 ans.</p><br /><p>L&#039;idée est bien;</p><div class="codebox"><pre><code>rsyslog=&gt; EXPLAIN SELECT * FROM systemevents WHERE fromhost = &#039;XXXX&#039; ORDER BY id desc LIMIT 10;
                                          QUERY PLAN
-----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
